dates go_err_parameter v1
description "An input with the alias err. Every function of the Go code keeps its errors in the variable err, which here is the parameter, of another type, so the Go code does not compile (W001). Every other target takes it as it is"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  err      : int   range >=0 <=3

date due = received
  + err days
